ROLLOUT & LATENCY MODEL
===============================================================================

Client view:

    C_t = predicted(S_t)

Server truth:

    S_t = Ξ(S_{t-1}, I_t)

Error condition:

    H(C_t) ≠ H(S_t)

Resolution:

    rollback → deterministic replay → resync

IMPORTANT:
Visual smoothness is independent of simulation truth.

